# Host-side ports for the local dev stack (docker-compose.dev.yml + Makefile).
# Copy this file to .env and override whatever clashes with other work on
# your machine — see README.md "Ports" for a worked example. Only the host
# side of each mapping is configurable; container-internal ports (and the
# four zone-app dev servers, 4301-4304) are fixed.
#
# Every value below is the current default — an empty/missing .env behaves
# exactly like today.

HMS_PG_PORT=5432
HMS_NATS_PORT=4222
HMS_NATS_MONITOR_PORT=8222
HMS_REDIS_PORT=6379
HMS_OPENFGA_PORT=8090
HMS_ZITADEL_PORT=20080
HMS_ZITADEL_PG_PORT=5433
HMS_API_PORT=8080

# ZITADEL_LOGIN_CLIENT_TOKEN is NOT a port and normally does not belong in
# this file — `make dev-api` reads it straight from
# dev/zitadel/secrets/login-client.pat (written by Zitadel's own
# first-instance provisioning) and needs no override on a normal clone.
# Set it here ONLY if you are pointing dev-api at a login-client PAT that
# did not come from this machine's own dev/zitadel/secrets/ (e.g. a
# shared remote Zitadel). Never commit a real value — this repo is public
# to anyone who can read the source, and this PAT can finalise an OIDC
# auth request for ANY app on the Zitadel instance it targets (see
# backend/internal/config/config.go's ZitadelLoginClientToken doc comment).
# ZITADEL_LOGIN_CLIENT_TOKEN=
